::meta{crate: tomet-zed, dependencies: list(), dependents: list()}

=[tomet-zed]

Zed editor extension for the Tomet document language and cotomet data files.

==[Overview]

Provides Zed editor support for Tomet files (`.tmt`) and cotomet data files
(`.ctmt`), integrating syntax highlighting and launching the language server
(`tomet-lsp`).

==[Language Server]

The extension locates `tomet-lsp` on `$PATH` within the worktree environment
and connects it to Zed's language server protocol client.
